      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "State Holds Secret Values\nThe state stores every attribute that\nTerraform reads or writes, in plain text:\n\n- `aws_iam_access_key` stores the secret key\nof an IAM user ([access key doc](https://githu\nb.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6\n.73.0/website/docs/r/iam_access_key.html.markd\nown#L77)).\n- `aws_secretsmanager_secret_version` stores\nthe secret value.\n- `aws_db_instance` stores the master\npassword.\n- A data source that reads a secret stores it\ntoo.\n\nWrite-only arguments, such as\n`secret_string_wo` and `password_wo`, keep a\nvalue out of the state. They need Terraform\n1.11 or later ([secret version doc](https://gi\nthub.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob\n/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/secretsmanager_secret_\nversion.html.markdown#L15)). A program can\nalso read a secret at run time by its ARN, so\nthe value never passes through Terraform.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4f84b61db706",
      "originalText": "State Holds Secret Values\nThe state stores every attribute that Terraform reads or writes, in plain text:\n\n- `aws_iam_access_key` stores the secret key of an IAM user ([access key doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/iam_access_key.html.markdown#L77)).\n- `aws_secretsmanager_secret_version` stores the secret value.\n- `aws_db_instance` stores the master password.\n- A data source that reads a secret stores it too.\n\nWrite-only arguments, such as `secret_string_wo` and `password_wo`, keep a value out of the state. They need Terraform 1.11 or later ([secret version doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/secretsmanager_secret_version.html.markdown#L15)). A program can also read a secret at run time by its ARN, so the value never passes through Terraform.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "state-holds-secret-values"
      }
    },
    {
