    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8567666255,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-5b4bacb933fe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1420.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 665.0,
      "seed": 231156,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deletes Differ by Service\nA destroy in the plan means different things\nfor different services:\n\n| Resource | What a destroy does |\n| --- | --- |\n| `aws_s3_bucket` | Fails if the bucket holds\nobjects, unless `force_destroy` is true; then\nit deletes all objects and versions first\n([bucket doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/ter\nraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/\nr/s3_bucket.html.markdown#L58)). |\n| `aws_secretsmanager_secret` | Schedules the\nsecret for deletion after a recovery window,\n30 days by default ([secret doc](https://githu\nb.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6\n.73.0/website/docs/r/secretsmanager_secret.htm\nl.markdown#L44)). |\n| `aws_db_instance` | Fails while\n`deletion_protection` is on; otherwise it\ntakes a final snapshot unless\n`skip_final_snapshot` is true ([db_instance do\nc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-prov\nider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/db_instan\nce.html.markdown#L332)). |\n| `aws_kms_key` | Schedules the key for\ndeletion after a waiting period of 7 to 30\ndays ([key doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/t\nerraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/doc\ns/r/kms_key.html.markdown#L316)). |\n| `aws_sns_topic_policy` | Resets the policy\nto the default instead of deleting it\n([provider code](https://github.com/hashicorp/\nterraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/internal/s\nervice/sns/topic_policy.go#L108-L122)). |\n\nSo `-` in a plan can mean \"gone now\", \"gone in\n30 days\" or \"reset\".",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-5b4bacb933fe",
      "originalText": "Deletes Differ by Service\nA destroy in the plan means different things for different services:\n\n| Resource | What a destroy does |\n| --- | --- |\n| `aws_s3_bucket` | Fails if the bucket holds objects, unless `force_destroy` is true; then it deletes all objects and versions first ([bucket doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/s3_bucket.html.markdown#L58)). |\n| `aws_secretsmanager_secret` | Schedules the secret for deletion after a recovery window, 30 days by default ([secret doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/secretsmanager_secret.html.markdown#L44)). |\n| `aws_db_instance` | Fails while `deletion_protection` is on; otherwise it takes a final snapshot unless `skip_final_snapshot` is true ([db_instance doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/db_instance.html.markdown#L332)). |\n| `aws_kms_key` | Schedules the key for deletion after a waiting period of 7 to 30 days ([key doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/kms_key.html.markdown#L316)). |\n| `aws_sns_topic_policy` | Resets the policy to the default instead of deleting it ([provider code](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/internal/service/sns/topic_policy.go#L108-L122)). |\n\nSo `-` in a plan can mean \"gone now\", \"gone in 30 days\" or \"reset\".",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "deletes-differ-by-service"
      }
    },
