    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1454843210,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-3f3194462ffc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 2460.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 385.0,
      "seed": 378066,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| `-/+ aws_s3_bucket` | A new bucket name; S3\ncannot rename a bucket, so the data stays in\nthe old one or is lost with it. |\n| The same `~` on a notification, policy or\nsecurity group in every plan | Two owners\nwrite one document. |\n| `-/+ aws_iam_policy` after a description\nchange | A new description forces a new policy\n([policy doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/ter\nraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/\nr/iam_policy.html.markdown#L45)). |\n| `~ engine_version` back to an older value on\n`aws_db_instance` | AWS upgraded the minor\nversion; AWS will reject a downgrade. |\n| `~ tags_all` with no tag change | Tags from\n`default_tags` differ from the live tags. |\n| `- aws_secretsmanager_secret` | The secret\nis scheduled for deletion; its name stays\ntaken during the recovery window. |",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3f3194462ffc",
      "originalText": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| `-/+ aws_s3_bucket` | A new bucket name; S3 cannot rename a bucket, so the data stays in the old one or is lost with it. |\n| The same `~` on a notification, policy or security group in every plan | Two owners write one document. |\n| `-/+ aws_iam_policy` after a description change | A new description forces a new policy ([policy doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/iam_policy.html.markdown#L45)). |\n| `~ engine_version` back to an older value on `aws_db_instance` | AWS upgraded the minor version; AWS will reject a downgrade. |\n| `~ tags_all` with no tag change | Tags from `default_tags` differ from the live tags. |\n| `- aws_secretsmanager_secret` | The secret is scheduled for deletion; its name stays taken during the recovery window. |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "aws-plan-signals"
      }
    },
