      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lambda Zips Built at Plan Time\nThe data source `archive_file` builds the zip\nfile of a Lambda function during the plan\n([archive provider](https://github.com/hashico\nrp/terraform-provider-archive/blob/v2.8.1/docs\n/data-sources/file.md#L10)). The apply needs\nthe same file. When plan and apply run on\ndifferent machines, the apply cannot find it.\n`source_code_hash` detects only the code\nchanges that pass through Terraform. The newer\nargument `code_sha256` also catches code\nchanged outside Terraform ([function doc](http\ns://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aw\ns/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/lambda_function.\nhtml.markdown#L715)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-533d2489368b",
      "originalText": "Lambda Zips Built at Plan Time\nThe data source `archive_file` builds the zip file of a Lambda function during the plan ([archive provider](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-archive/blob/v2.8.1/docs/data-sources/file.md#L10)). The apply needs the same file. When plan and apply run on different machines, the apply cannot find it. `source_code_hash` detects only the code changes that pass through Terraform. The newer argument `code_sha256` also catches code changed outside Terraform ([function doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/lambda_function.html.markdown#L715)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "lambda-zips-built-at-plan-time"
      }
    },
