      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4331439217,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-104af0ff58d3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1915.6,
      "y": 4285.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 553102,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deleted Principals Break Trust\nWhen IAM deletes a user or role that a trust\npolicy names, it replaces the ARN in the\npolicy with an internal ID. A new role with\nthe same name does not restore the trust,\nbecause it has a new ID ([principals](https://\ndocs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/refer\nence_policies_elements_principal.html)). So a\nreplaced role silently locks out the systems\nthat it trusted, and the systems that trusted\nit. Trust policies that name temporary session\nARNs have the same weakness.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-104af0ff58d3",
      "originalText": "Deleted Principals Break Trust\nWhen IAM deletes a user or role that a trust policy names, it replaces the ARN in the policy with an internal ID. A new role with the same name does not restore the trust, because it has a new ID ([principals](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_policies_elements_principal.html)). So a replaced role silently locks out the systems that it trusted, and the systems that trusted it. Trust policies that name temporary session ARNs have the same weakness.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "deleted-principals-break-trust"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3412065349,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-ea15b27ee859",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
