    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7949425442,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-59b5478ad985",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1940.8,
      "y": 5546.5,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 815451,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Inline Security Group Rules Win\nA security group with inline `ingress` or\n`egress` blocks owns all its rules. Its next\napply removes rules that someone added by\nhand, by script or from another configuration.\nThe provider warns against mixing inline rules\nwith separate rule resources ([security group \nnote](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-p\nrovider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/securi\nty_group.html.markdown#L13-L15)). Use one\nseparate resource for each rule, such as\n`aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule`.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-59b5478ad985",
      "originalText": "Inline Security Group Rules Win\nA security group with inline `ingress` or `egress` blocks owns all its rules. Its next apply removes rules that someone added by hand, by script or from another configuration. The provider warns against mixing inline rules with separate rule resources ([security group note](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/v6.73.0/website/docs/r/security_group.html.markdown#L13-L15)). Use one separate resource for each rule, such as `aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule`.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "inline-rules-win"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
