    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8528661832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-b785e9a25001",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 6312.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 175.0,
      "seed": 755062,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Choose the External ID\nWhen both sides of a trust use an external ID\nthat you chose, one apply creates the role and\nthe other system's integration together.\nNobody copies values, and a recreated\nintegration keeps working. Because AWS does\nnot treat the external ID as a secret, it can\nlive in configuration ([external ID](https://d\nocs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_rol\nes_common-scenarios_third-party.html)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b785e9a25001",
      "originalText": "Choose the External ID\nWhen both sides of a trust use an external ID that you chose, one apply creates the role and the other system's integration together. Nobody copies values, and a recreated integration keeps working. Because AWS does not treat the external ID as a secret, it can live in configuration ([external ID](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_common-scenarios_third-party.html)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "aws-choose-the-external-id"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7921118523,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-b7819e8c4084",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
      "y": 6539.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 181.5,
      "seed": 645080,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
