      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7493536010,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-84fb7a74e7ba",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 6761.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.40000000000003,
      "height": 315.0,
      "seed": 994829,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Contracts Between Configurations\nOne configuration can need a value that\nanother one created, such as a certificate ARN\nor a queue ARN. Three ways exist:\n\n- Copy the value by hand into variables. It is\nsimple, but the copy goes stale without\nwarning.\n- Look the resource up by name or tag with a\ndata source. The name becomes the contract.\n- Publish the value as an SSM parameter in one\nconfiguration and read it with\n`data.aws_ssm_parameter` in the other. The\nparameter name becomes the contract, and a\nchange flows on the next plan.\n\nThe last two follow a change; the first one\ndoes not.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-84fb7a74e7ba",
      "originalText": "Contracts Between Configurations\nOne configuration can need a value that another one created, such as a certificate ARN or a queue ARN. Three ways exist:\n\n- Copy the value by hand into variables. It is simple, but the copy goes stale without warning.\n- Look the resource up by name or tag with a data source. The name becomes the contract.\n- Publish the value as an SSM parameter in one configuration and read it with `data.aws_ssm_parameter` in the other. The parameter name becomes the contract, and a change flows on the next plan.\n\nThe last two follow a change; the first one does not.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "contracts-between-configurations"
      }
    },
